            badAttributes: ['bgcolor', 'border', 'cellpadding', 'cellspacing', 'height', 'lang', 'id', 'onclick', 'onload', 'onmouseenter', 'onmouseleave', 'onmousemove', 'onmouseout', 'onmouseover', 'start', 'style', 'class', 'valign', 'width'], /*Remove attributes from remaining tags*/
            limitChars: 0, // 0|# 0 disables option
            limitDisplay: 'none', // none|text|html|both
            limitStop: false, // true/false
            notTimeOut: 850,
            imagePlaceholder: ''
        },
        AdvancedDragAndDrop: {
            enabled: true
        }
    },
    CommentsEditorConfig: {
        focus: false,
        minHeight: 405,
        disableDragAndDrop: true,
        defaultProtocol: 'https://',
        popover: {
            image: [
                ['attributes', ['imageAttributes']],
                ['imageResize', ['resizeFull', 'resizeHalf', 'resizeQuarter', 'resizeNone']],
                ['float', ['floatLeft', 'floatRight', 'floatNone']],
                ['remove', ['removeMedia']]
            ],
            link: [['link', ['editAdvLink', 'unlink']]]
        },
        /*if this config is changed check both initInPage and initClassicform*/
        toolbar: [
            ['font', ['bold', 'italic', 'underline']],
            ['insert', ['advLink', 'mediaLib']],
            ['view', ['toggleFullScreen']]
        ],
        cleaner: {
            action: 'paste',
            keepHtml: true,
            keepTagContents: ['abbr', 'acronym', 'address', 'area', 'article', 'aside', 'audio', 'b', 'base', 'basefont', 'beaconregion', 'bdi', 'bdo', 'bgsound', 'big', 'blink', 'blockquote', 'body', 'br', 'button', 'canvas', 'caption', 'center', 'cite', 'code', 'content', 'data', 'datalist', 'dd', 'del', 'details', 'dfn', 'dialog', 'dir', 'div', 'dl', 'dt', 'em', 'embed', 'fieldset', 'figcaption', 'figure', 'font', 'footer', 'form', 'frame', 'frameset', 'head', 'header', 'h1', 'h2', 'h3', 'h4', 'h5', 'h6', 'hgroup', 'hr', 'html', 'i', 'iframe', 'image', 'img', 'input', 'ins', 'kbd', 'keygen', 'label', 'legend', 'li', 'link', 'main', 'map', 'mark', 'marquee', 'menu', 'menuitem', 'meta', 'meter', 'nav', 'nobr', 'noembed', 'noframes', 'noscript', 'object', 'ol', 'optgroup', 'option', 'output', 'param', 'picture', 'plaintext', 'portal', 'pre', 'progress', 'q', 'rb', 'rp', 'rt', 'rtc', 'ruby', 's', 'samp', 'script', 'section', 'select', 'shadow', 'slot', 'small', 'source', 'spacer', 'span', 'strike', 'strong', 'style', 'sub', 'summary', 'sup', 'table', 'tbody', 'td', 'template', 'textarea', 'tfoot', 'th', 'thead', 'time', 'title', 'tr', 'track', 'tt', 'u', 'ul', 'var', 'video', 'wbr', 'xmp', 'accesskey', 'autocapitalize', 'autofocus', 'class', 'contenteditable', 'contextmenu', 'data-*', 'dir', 'draggable', 'enterkeyhint', 'hidden', 'id', 'inputmode', 'is', 'itemid', 'itemprop', 'itemref', 'itemscope', 'itemtype', 'lang', 'nonce', 'part', 'slot', 'spellcheck', 'style', 'tabindex', 'title', 'translate', 'x-ms-acceleratorkey', 'x-ms-format-detection', 'input'], //Remove tags and keep the contents
            badTags: ['applet', 'col', 'colgroup', 'embed', 'noframes', 'iframe', 'noscript', 'script', 'style', 'head'],
            badAttributes: ['bgcolor', 'border', 'cellpadding', 'cellspacing', 'height', 'lang', 'id', 'onclick', 'onload', 'onmouseenter', 'onmouseleave', 'onmousemove', 'onmouseout', 'onmouseover', 'start', 'style', 'class', 'valign', 'width'], /*Remove attributes from remaining tags*/
            limitChars: 0, // 0|# 0 disables option
            limitDisplay: 'none', // none|text|html|both
            limitStop: false, // true/false
            notTimeOut: 850,
            imagePlaceholder: ''
        },
        AdvancedDragAndDrop: {
            enabled: true
        }
    },
    initInPage: function (elem, pii, api) {

        //Hide text area
        $elem = $(elem);
        $pii = $(pii);
        $elem.hide();

        api.getConfigModeFromPii(pii, api, $elem);
    },
    initInClassicForm: function ($textArea, api) {
        /* There are three important ids/names:
         * The containing div is InputID + "div"
         * The html view (for display forms) is InputID + "view"
         * The text area (defaults to hidden) is InputID
         */
        var inputID = '#' + $textArea.prop('id');
        $inputContainerDIV = $textArea.closest(inputID + 'div');
        var oOptions = $textArea.data('richtext-options');

        $htmlView = $inputContainerDIV.find(inputID + 'view');
        $htmlView.hide();
        //Get editor config
        var $form = $textArea.closest('form');
        var sFormId = $form.attr('id');
        var formWindow = sFormId + '_win';
        var f_handle = findTop()[formWindow].fhandle;
        api.getConfigModeFromSorceAppHandle(f_handle, api, $textArea, oOptions);
    },
    initEditor: function ($elem, api, overrideConfig) {
        //Get editor config
        var editorConfig;
        if (overrideConfig == undefined) {
            editorConfig = api.AllOptionsEditorConfig;
        } else {
            editorConfig = overrideConfig;
        }
        if (BEACON.Constants && BEACON.Constants.jugglMediaEnabled) {
            var editorConfigString = JSON.stringify(editorConfig)        
            editorConfig = JSON.parse(editorConfigString.replace('video', 'jugglMedia'))
        };
        //Set language
        editorConfig.lang = $elem.data('richtext-lang');
        $elem.summernote(editorConfig);
    },
    init: function (mode, target) {
        var api = this;
        switch (mode) {
            case 'InPage':
                //find the enabled textareas boxes
                $pii = $(target);
                $pii.find('textarea[data-richtext-enabled=true]').each(function () {
                    var $textArea = $(this);
                    //only init once to prevent multiple editors
                    if ($textArea.siblings('.note-editor').length === 0 && $textArea.data('richtext-enabled-onclick') != true) {
                            api.initInPage(this, $pii, api);
                    }
                });
                break;
            case 'InPageOnClick':
                if (target.data('richtext-enabled') == true && target.siblings('.note-editor').length === 0) {
                    api.initInPage(target, target.closest('.pi'), api);
                }
                break;
            case 'ClassicForm':
                //Custom path for classic forms (target = jquery object for text area)
                if (target.data('richtext-enabled') == true) {
                    api.initInClassicForm(target, api);
                }
                break;
            default:
                break;
        }
    },
    initOnLoad: function () {
        var api = this;
        //Ensure labels are loaded for custom plugins
        BEACON.GetLabelTextFromServer(api.labelHandles, function (LabelData) {
            BEACON.Labels.AddLabelsToCache(LabelData);
        });
        //find all inpage contributions and add editor init
        $('.pi .pageItemHeader a.inlineAdd').click(function () {
            api.init.bind(api)('InPage', $(this).closest('.pi'));
        });

        //find all click in textareas
        $('.pi textarea[data-richtext-enabled-onclick=true]').each(function () {
            var $textArea = $(this);
            //for text areas enabled with the editor and for onclick event
            if ($textArea.data('richtext-enabled') == true && $textArea.data('richtext-enabled-onclick') == true && $textArea.data('richtext-init-added') != true) {
                $textArea.data('richtext-init-added', true);
                $textArea.on('focus', function (evt) {
                    //prevent mentions from firing while inialising the editor
                    evt.preventDefault(); evt.stopImmediatePropagation();
                    api.init.bind(api)('InPageOnClick', $textArea);
                });
            }
        });

        //check on all content updates
        $('.pi').each(function(){
            var $pii = $(this);
            var $PiiContent = $pii.find('div[id$=_content]');
            $pii.on('BEACON:PII:allUpdate', function () {
                //find all inpage contributions and add editor init
                $PiiContent.find('.pageItemHeader a.inlineAdd').click(function () {
                    api.init.bind(api)('InPage', $pii);
                });

                //find all click in textareas
                $PiiContent.find('textarea[data-richtext-enabled-onclick=true]').each(function () {
                    var $textArea = $(this);
                    //for text areas enabled with the editor and for onclick event
                    if ($textArea.data('richtext-enabled') == true && $textArea.data('richtext-enabled-onclick') == true && $textArea.data('richtext-init-added') != true) {
                        $textArea.data('richtext-init-added', true);
                        $textArea.on('focus', function (evt) {
                            //prevent mentions from firing while inialising the editor
                            evt.preventDefault(); evt.stopImmediatePropagation();
                            api.init.bind(api)('InPageOnClick', $textArea);
                        });
                    }
                });
            });
        });
    },

    configModeSelection: function (api, $elem, response) {
        switch (parseInt(response.responseText)) {
            case Config.BasicEditor:
                //init Editor
                return api.defaultEditorConfig;
                break;
            case Config.AdvEditorCodeOnly:
                //init Editor
                return api.CodeViewOnlyEditorConfig;
                break;
            case Config.AdvEditorPasteOnly:
                //init Editor
                return api.PasteOnlyEditorConfig;
                break;
            case Config.AdvEditorAllOptions:
                //init Editor
               return api.AllOptionsEditorConfig;
                break;
            case Config.AdvEditorComments:
                //init Editor
                return api.CommentsEditorConfig;
                break;
            default:
                //init Editor
                return api.defaultEditorConfig;
                break;
        }
    },

    getConfigModeFromSorceAppHandle: function (formHandle, api, $elem, oOptions) {

        Config = {
            BasicEditor: 0,
            AdvEditorCodeOnly: 1,
            AdvEditorPasteOnly: 2,
            AdvEditorAllOptions: 3,
            AdvEditorComments: 4
        }
        data = { sorceFormHandle: formHandle};

        //Do the full save ASHX
        ashxURL = "/sorce/beacon/PageItem/AppAspx/generic/getEditorConfigMode.ashx";
        $.ajax({
            url: ashxURL
            , method: 'POST'
            , dataType: "json"
            , data: JSON.stringify(data)
            , contentType: "application/json"
            , complete: function (response) {
                var config = api.configModeSelection(api, $elem, response);
                api.formInitPostConfigSelection(config, api, $elem, oOptions);
            }
            , error: function (xhr, status, errorthrown) {
                if (xhr.responseText) {

                }
            }
        });

    },

    formInitPostConfigSelection: function(editorConfig, api, $textArea, oOptions) {
        /*change config to use classic media library picker
         * (5th array "insert" button group,
         *  the 2nd item for the buttons in the gorup,
         *  3rd button in the array)*/
        //editorConfig.toolbar[4][1][2] = "classicMediaLib";
        var toolbar = JSON.stringify(editorConfig.toolbar);
        toolbar = toolbar.replace("mediaLib", "classicMediaLib");
        editorConfig.toolbar = JSON.parse(toolbar);
        editorConfig.minHeight = "";
        api.initEditor($textArea, api, editorConfig);
        //Force the editor to fill the space (this has to be done after editor init as the toolbar might spread over more than one line!)
        $editor = $inputContainerDIV.find('.note-editor');
        $editorToolbar = $editor.find('.note-toolbar');
        $editorEditable = $editor.find('.note-editable');
        $editorCodeView = $editor.find('.note-codable');
        $editorStatus = $editor.find('.note-statusbar');
        $editorStatus.data('ishiddenalways', true);
        $editorStatus.hide();

        //Get any padding or borders applied
        var heightDiff = $inputContainerDIV.outerHeight() - $inputContainerDIV.height();
        //Add any additional padding or borders applied
        heightDiff += $editor.outerHeight() - $editor.height();
        var strHeightCSS = "calc(" + oOptions.fixed_height + " - " + ($editorToolbar.outerHeight() + heightDiff) + "px);";
        $editorEditable.attr("style", "height: " + strHeightCSS);
        $editorCodeView.attr("style", "height: " + strHeightCSS);

        //Add event to ensure the height is consistent when codeview is toggled
        $textArea.on('summernote.codeview.toggled', function () {
            $editorEditable.attr("style", "height: " + strHeightCSS);
            $editorCodeView.attr("style", "height: " + strHeightCSS);
        });

        //apply mentions
        var formWindow = $textArea.closest('form').attr('id') + '_win';
        $editorEditable.addClass(api.mentionsHelperClass);
        findTop()[formWindow].EngageMentions.AllQuery(undefined, oOptions.mentions_zpos);

        //Ensure enter does not interfere with mentions
        $textArea.on('summernote.enter', function (winevt, evt) {
            if ($textArea.closest('body').find(api.mentionsDropdownSelector).is(':visible')) {
                evt.preventDefault();
            }
        });

        //Ensure mentions are picked up
        $textArea.on('summernote.blur', function (we, contents, $editable) {
            //fire on change event for mentions
            $textArea.change();
        });

        //Fix for chrome inserting unwanted SPAN's
        $editorEditable.on("DOMNodeInserted", function (e) {
            if (e.target.tagName === "SPAN") {
                $(e.target).replaceWith($(e.target).contents());
            }
        });

        //Update mentions area to show whats already in content
        $textArea.change();
    },

    getConfigModeFromPii: function ($pii, api, $elem) {

        Config = {
            BasicEditor: 0,
            AdvEditorCodeOnly: 1,
            AdvEditorPasteOnly: 2,
            AdvEditorAllOptions: 3,
            AdvEditorComments: 4
        }
        data = { pageItemInstanceId: $pii.prop('id') };

        //Do the full save ASHX
        ashxURL = "/sorce/beacon/PageItem/AppAspx/generic/getEditorConfigMode.ashx";
        $.ajax({
            url: ashxURL
            , method: 'POST'
            , dataType: "json"
            , data: JSON.stringify(data)
            , contentType: "application/json"
            , complete: function (response) {
                var config = api.configModeSelection(api, $elem, response);
                api.initEditor($elem, api, config);
                api.piiInitPostConfigSelection($pii, api, $elem);
            }
            , error: function (xhr, status, errorthrown) {
                if (xhr.responseText) {

                }
            }
        });

    },
    piiInitPostConfigSelection: function ($pii, api, $elem) {
        //integrate mentions helper
        $pii.find('.note-editor.note-frame .note-editable').addClass(api.mentionsHelperClass);
        $pii.trigger('BEACON:PII:allUpdate');

        //Ensure enter does not interfere with mentions
        $elem.on('summernote.enter', function (winevt, evt) {
            if ($(api.mentionsDropdownSelector).is(':visible')) {
                evt.preventDefault();
            }
        });

        //Resolve the height issue on code view toggle
        $elem.on('summernote.codeview.toggled', function () {
            if ($elem.summernote('codeview.isActivated')) {
                $editor = $elem.parent().find('.note-editor');
                $editorEditable = $editor.find('.note-editable');
                $editorCodable = $editor.find('.note-codable');
                $editorCodable.css('min-height', $editorEditable.outerHeight());
            }
        });
    }
}

BEACON.lazyLoading = {

    init: function () {
        BEACON.lazyLoading.AttachObserversToAllImages();

        $(document).on("BEACON:PII:allUpdate", function () {
            BEACON.lazyLoading.AttachObserversToAllImages();
        });
    },

    AttachObserversToAllImages: function () {
        const images = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('img.lazyLoad'));

        if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
            const imageObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {
                entries.forEach(entry => {
                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                        const image = entry.target;

                        image.src = image.dataset.src;
                        imageObserver.unobserve(image);
                        $(image).removeClass("lazyLoad");
                    }
                });
            });

            images.forEach(img => imageObserver.observe(img));
        }
    }
}